WEBVTT

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:52.370
Hina loves it when you do this, Tomoe.

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.690
There, all done.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:56.160
Thank you.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.900
Tomo-chan, you'll be late.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:11.450
Okay!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.270
School today too?

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:16.470
Yeah.

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:25.850
I'll come home by evening.
Let's play together after that.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:27.290
Okay?

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:29.440
It's a promise!

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.060
Between you and Hina...

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.800
A promise you just have to keep.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.830
All right.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.670
Hina-Ichigo

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:51.340
Mishima's cream puffs 
with red bean paste.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:55.220
They're really popular right now.
I bought them for you, Shinku-chan.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.970
What a cute way of eating!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.770
Shut up! Enough, get out!

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.430
Just a little longer!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:12.380
But what a mysterious doll.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.040
I want to hug you!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.220
Don't touch me.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.220
Nori?

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:19.890
Yes?

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.320
Go make tea.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.680
Nothing lukewarm, now.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.200
Quickly.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.040
R-Right!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.590
You're siblings, all right.
Useless in the same way.

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:30.650
Don't say that.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:31.780
Jun.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:33.790
Close the window.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.650
Jun, it's cold.

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:39.610
It's not there! It's your fault!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.890
You're wrecking everything!

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.830
Oh? I did not break anything.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.200
How can you say that so 
calmly. You little...

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.260
Honestly, 
so easily flustered.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:54.570
Watch.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.670
How'd you do that just now?

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:34.410
Must I explain that as well?

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.360
Hey, where are you going?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.460
I can't have a quiet cup of tea here.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:41.880
Hey, now...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.810
It's not like I've become 
your servant, okay?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:52.660
Jun.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:55.400
Open that door for me.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.890
This one?
 But this is...

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:59.700
Just open it.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.560
What an odd table.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:04.810
I've never seen its like.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.810
The room is small, but 
I like the perfume.

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.040
Oh, what are you doing?

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.310
Nori.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.880
Bring me tea here.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.260
But...

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.490
Don't you know?

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.780
This is the bathroom.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.160
Sit. Poop.

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:27.190
Flush.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.370
Got it?

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.340
Hey, what's gotten into you?

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:42.480
Is this you being embarrassed?
You've got a cute side...

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.940
Yes?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.020
Oh.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:55.090
Tomoe-chan.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.020
The printouts from school.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:01.480
Thanks. Sorry to trouble you.

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:03.170
Well, excuse me.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:05.240
W-Want some tea?

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.900
No, I have things to do.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.180
Tomoe-chan!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:14.940
I'm fine.

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:16.270
But...

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.170
Thanks for waiting.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.690
Please don't mind me.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:34.700
I'm really fine now.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.900
But you're still pale...

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.830
Couldn't you at least have a cup of tea?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.340
Coming all this way must be hard.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:47.840
It's the class rep's job...

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.650
You became a class rep!

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:51.480
Yes.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:52.700
Impressive.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.340
Not at all.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:54.210
How's school?

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:56.800
It's fine.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.980
H-How are the cream puffs?

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.250
The red bean paste and custard...

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.220
What's your name?

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.680
You can't come out now.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.560
Why not?

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.640
Just put these on.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:16.550
Not a word in front of her, okay?

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.240
Did that scare you?

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.040
She's a new kind of cat-ear figure.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.140
Isn't she well made?

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:25.520
Um, well?

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.010
See? The ears move.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.300
What do you think?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:34.480
Ow...

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:37.820
Hey, Shinku!
 Where are you, Shinku?

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.550
Jeez, don't wander off on your own.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:44.790
Sorry for troubling you.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.050
Is something wrong?

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.320
Jun-kun...

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.080
Thank you for having me.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.540
Tomoe-chan...

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:24.600
Jun-kun...

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.190
Holie.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.370
I have a little task.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:51.660
Shinku-chan, could I have a minute?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.680
Why don't you sleep 
in my room tonight?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:56.760
Why?

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.050
Jun-kun gets like that sometimes...

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:03.120
...and doesn't respond 
to things for a few days.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.080
I see.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:09.330
It seems better to leave him alone
at times like that, so...

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.540
So... Okay?

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.300
I do not really mind.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:21.440
But is that really the 
right thing to do?

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.230
Liar!
 Tomoe, you liar!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.990
You said you'd be back by evening!

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.190
You said you'd play with Hina!

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:34.370
You said you'd definitely 
keep that promise!

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.240
Tomo-chan, a minute?

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.040
Coming.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:45.890
You're going?

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.500
I'll be right back.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.610
Liar!

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.520
The last one was like that too.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:54.090
She said she'd be right back...

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.590
...and locked Hina in the box.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.550
And for a long, long, long time...

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:08.590
I won't do that, okay?

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:11.800
No!

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.140
No more being alone.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.930
Let's be together forever.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.440
Forever...

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.060
H-Hina-Ichigo!

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.460
Come.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.200
Let us go together.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:35.690
Come.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.470
No!

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:44.350
Hina-Ichigo!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.110
Tomo-chan!

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:58.410
Tomo-chan!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.920
Tomo-chan!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.760
100 Ways to Resolve
Teenage Problems

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:44.100
I guess it's necessary
to leave him alone at times...

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.400
What was that?

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:53.920
Could that be a shooting star?

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:57.800
I wish Jun gets better.
I wish Jun gets better. I wish Jun...

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.370
The culprit is you, Tanu!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.000
You got me!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.400
You were afraid of losing 
your stardom to Raccoon

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:06.230
The window?

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:07.080
and shoved him into the lake!

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.820
Take care of that yourself.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:10.320
He's a new species, 
and he raided our territory too!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.320
How was it?

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.220
I see.

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:12.320
Shinku-chan!

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.020
Did you see a shooting star... Oh!

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:16.900
Wait!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.750
Please, I just want one!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.760
I only want one wish granted!

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.060
Wai...

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:27.480
Say, Nori.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.450
Does this house have a large mirror?

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.670
Mirror?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:42.350
I can use this.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.480
Use?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:48.080
There are objects that have 
a bit of life in them...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.010
and those that do not.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.090
This mirror has that quality.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.320
Sorry, I'm stupid, 
so physics is beyond me...

00:12:57.320 --> 00:13:00.690
Oh, I know. 
Engel's coefficient law.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.230
I'll be going now.

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:05.120
Now? 
Alone?

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.910
You needn't worry.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.710
Without a medium, 
I have 30 minutes at best.

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.080
Did you tell Jun-kun?

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:16.180
It's better to leave him alone, no?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.890
Well...

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:21.670
That's what the book said, so...

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:22.710
Nori.

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:28.190
The one that truly understands Jun
is not a book but you.

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.750
Jun will find the 
correct answer himself.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:35.480
Though he seems a bit lost now.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.600
But...

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:40.000
Just stay by his side until then.

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:44.640
What's sad is a lonely child
who's lost sight of himself.

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:48.830
If you leave them be,
there will be no turning back.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.300
Tomo-chan!

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:00.980
Tomo-chan...

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.040
Mother!

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:06.440
Hina-Ichigo, please 
let me go back to my room.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.030
Why?

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.530
Do you hate being with Hina?

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.140
That's not it.

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.540
That's not it, but...

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.200
Tomoe...

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.810
No!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.120
Again...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.220
You can't run away.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:34.530
Because you and Hina
made a promise to stay together.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.230
What is this?

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:42.630
Tomoe.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.500
Let's play.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:46.100
Tomoe.

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.500
N-No...

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.840
Come on, Tomoe.

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.140
Hold it.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:52.920
Who's there?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.510
It's been a while, Hina-Ichigo.

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.330
Shinku.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.180
Oh, you came to play too, right?

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.150
Wrong.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:08.500
Honestly, what Nori made me
bring doesn't look proper.

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:11.450
I came here for the Alice Game.

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.060
The Alice Game... No!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:15.990
Not now!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:16.900
Why?

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:19.730
Hina wants to play more with Tomoe!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:22.420
Oh, then just win the game.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.080
The Alice Game...

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.220
A game where we fight 
for Rosa Mysticas.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:34.450
The defeated becomes a doll
that can neither speak nor move.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:38.690
The victor grows one step closer
to becoming Alice.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:43.690
That is the fate bestowed upon us
Rozen Maidens.

00:15:44.270 --> 00:15:47.130
Don't you have the confidence to win?

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.430
Shinku, you meanie!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.120
No progress at all.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.600
Crying and whining as always...

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:57.170
That's why you end up alone.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.880
I'm not crying!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.280
You can just...

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:02.010
You can just...

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.910
...become flat as a 
pancake for all I care!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.010
It's hot...

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:15.560
If it's this hot, she's probably
fighting some weird doll again...

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:31.620
I'm never, 
ever going to lose!

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:32.570
Take this!

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.410
Hina-Ichigo...

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.010
Surrender quietly.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:15.950
Without a medium...

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:18.650
...it seems my powers 
are roughly halved.

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.120
Shinku...

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.580
No, I won't lose.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:26.750
If Hina loses,
it means leaving Tomoe!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.090
I don't want that!

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:40.380
N-No way!

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.380
No!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.070
I-I won?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.620
Now Tomoe and I can be...

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:06.210
No.

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:12.070
It can't be. Why?

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.880
Look behind you.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.370
Tomoe...

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:22.000
Tomoe!

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:26.310
Hina-Ichigo, you took
too much power from Tomoe.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.110
She will die at this rate.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.380
No...

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.550
Tomoe! Tomoe!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:35.630
Please, Tomoe.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:36.940
Open your eyes.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:39.150
Hina won't cry anymore!

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:40.940
Or act spoiled!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:42.390
So...

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:44.990
So...

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.770
Hina-Ichigo.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.710
If you absolutely want to save her...

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:53.270
...you know what to do, don't you?

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.580
Tomoe...

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.440
Hina-Ichigo...

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:36.410
I'm sorry, Tomoe.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:38.700
Goodbye.

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:46.560
Shinku, you can have 
Hina's Rosa Mystica.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.160
Don't form hasty conclusions.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:54.360
Taking your Rosa Mystica
is my decision to make.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:58.660
But without the ring, 
Hina has no power...

00:19:59.070 --> 00:19:59.870
True.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.140
You're just a child who can do nothing.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.600
If there were anything...

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:09.380
It's been 30 minutes...

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.430
What should I do?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.710
Jun-kun.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.380
Shin...

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:18.480
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:24.390
<i>The one that truly understands Jun
is not a book but you.</i>

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:30.320
Jun-kun, Shinku hasn't come back.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.040
Where'd she go?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.510
I don't really know...

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:39.320
Something about this room's mirror
being a doorway...

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.450
Don't tell me inside...

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.150
Ow...

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.450
Jun.

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:02.050
W-What?

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:03.750
You're late.

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.990
What?

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.900
Don't go and do iffy things!

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:09.730
I left word with Nori.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.670
If you had come...

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:12.410
Who cares.

00:21:16.780 --> 00:21:17.900
<i>Her ribbon...</i>

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.820
<i>So she was fighting...</i>

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:21.990
Eek!

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:23.230
What's her name?

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:25.640
What's her name?
What's her name?

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:26.920
Hina-Ichigo.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:28.920
She is my new servant.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:30.930
I don't like the dark.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.060
Oh, dear.

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:34.160
Let's go then.

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:39.270
Don't tell me she'll be living here too.

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:41.770
Oh, she's my servant.

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:44.510
Of course she'll live and work here.

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:46.810
I won't take this.

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:48.880
I won't take this!

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:51.610
Oh, it's three minutes past nine.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.980
Night is time for sleep.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.710
You should sleep soon too.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.830
Hey! How dare you!

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:59.150
Good night.

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:04.560
Hey, open up!

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.500
Shinku! Hey!

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:09.680
Why you! Shinku!

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:10.900
Open up!

00:23:42.180 --> 00:23:44.690
Come on, play with Hina.

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:46.680
Call me Shinku-sama.

00:23:46.680 --> 00:23:48.690
After all, 
you are my servant.

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:50.050
Shinku-sama?

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:52.700
Oh, we're playing princesses, right?

00:23:52.940 --> 00:23:54.560
I've had enough of this.

00:23:55.460 --> 00:23:59.420
Fine, if you won't play,
I won't give you any unyuu.

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:00.040
Unyuu?

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:02.510
Unyuu is unyuu!

00:24:02.510 --> 00:24:04.400
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:02.810 --> 00:24:10.950
Chapter 3
Suigintou

00:24:04.860 --> 00:24:07.840
Swear upon this rose ring.
